{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55115","headline":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 五 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"占宿次，今夜定如何。\n太乙天罡太冲上，支干见者恐奔过（京本作「波」），准（辛本、川本、京本作「整」）备御兵戈（京本作「预防他」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55115.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55115","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}